+## Domain Specialist Parallel Dispatch
+
+For full-stack or cross-cutting features, dispatch domain specialists in parallel when tasks are independent:
+
+| Parallel Pattern    | Agents                                                        | Example                                                      |
+| ------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------ |
+| Full-stack feature  | Backend Architect + Frontend Developer                        | API endpoint + UI component (no shared files)                |
+| Admin + Backend     | Admin Portal + Backend Architect                              | Admin dashboard + new API service (independent)              |
+| API + Docs          | API Specialist + Documenter                                   | OpenAPI spec + developer guide                               |
+| Multi-subsystem fix | Backend Architect (service A) + Backend Architect (service B) | Independent service bugs                                     |
+| Cross-app monorepo  | Specialist per app                                            | Same feature in `apps/web` + `apps/api` (no shared packages) |
+
+**Safe to parallelize:** Agents touch different files/directories with no shared state.
+**Still sequential:** Tasks that share files, database migrations, or API contracts that one depends on.
+
 ## When NOT to Use
 
 **Related failures:** Fixing one might fix others - investigate together first
